      "role": "user",
      "content": "so with lcc, if it requires such \"rigorous intellectual sorting,\" does that mean the risk of items just getting lost or slipping through the cracks is higher? i worry about a situation where items are tucked away in weird, illogical places because they don't fit the structure. is there a way to prevent that kind of systemic disorder?",
